  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appui aux travaux de SJM-Ha&#xef;ti dans la migration et la protection de l&apos;environnement dans le nord&apos;est d&apos;Ha&#xef;ti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project to support the work of SJM-Haiti in migration and environmental protection in the northeast of Haiti proposes actions to respond to the humanitarian assistance needs of migrant, repatriated and returned people from the Dominican Republic. It also proposes actions to resolve conflicts linked to the management and exploitation of common natural resources in the northern border zone between Haiti and the Dominican Republic.</narrative>
  </description>
